BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13 TL (A vacuum \223magic eye\224 tube \(EM80/6BR5\) whose shadow angle narrows as the dial approaches a station, driven from the) Tj T* (same tuning-distance signal used for the static \223swim\224 effect. Two ESP32 GPIOs drive it through 2N7000 MOSFETs: one) Tj T* (switches the 6.3V heater on/off, the other PWMs the control grid \(~5 kHz, RC-filtered\) to vary the shadow angle.) Tj T* (Anode/target voltage comes from a MAX1771-based boost module \(5V in, adjustable output, configured here to roughly) Tj T* (80V rather than its typical ~200V\). Full pin-out, wiring, and safety notes are reproduced from the reference schematic at) Tj T* (the end of this document.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
