.541176 .415686 .184314 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F3 10.5 Tf 14 TL (Home Assistant + Sonos + dashboard card) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48 615.8898 cm
q
.168627 .137255 .12549 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13 TL (HA automations watch the ESP32's published sensors \(Dial Mode, Radiola Preload Station, LP Progress\) to start/stop) Tj T* (Sonos playback, preload the next station's playlist muted while the dial is still in the static gap, and ramp volume on) Tj T* (arrival. A custom Lovelace card renders a vintage dial face with a live needle mirroring the physical pointer, a mode) Tj T* (badge, station/track label, and play/pause control.) Tj T* ET
